---
title: Nested states
---
stateDiagram
    %% the v1 header, keywords in any case, # comments
    [*] --> First
    STATE First {
        [*] --> second
        second --> [*]   # a comment
        State second {
            [*] --> third
            third --> [*]
            state Fourth {
                a --> b
            }
        }
    }
    First --> Last : done
    Last --> [*]
    note right of Last : one line
    hide empty description
    scale 350 width
    accTitle: A title
    state "Described" as D
    D : and a description
    Last --> D
    style D fill:#ccf,stroke:#00f
